WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
Settle into a supported seated position.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.490
An intention is not a prediction, promise, or demand that the day unfold a certain way.

3
00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:15.510
It is a modest quality you can return to while responding to what actually happens.

4
00:00:23.494 --> 00:00:25.904
Feel the body here before considering the day.

5
00:00:27.604 --> 00:00:32.604
Notice feet or support, one breath, and the light in the room.

6
00:00:49.236 --> 00:00:51.456
Let the day appear in broad outline.

7
00:00:53.156 --> 00:00:58.506
There may be work, care, travel, rest, uncertainty, or tasks you cannot yet see.

8
00:01:00.206 --> 00:01:02.186
Avoid rehearsing every detail.

9
00:01:22.145 --> 00:01:25.375
Ask: how would I like to meet what comes?

10
00:01:27.075 --> 00:01:30.295
Listen for a simple quality rather than an outcome.

11
00:01:31.995 --> 00:01:37.465
Perhaps steadiness, clarity, patience, courage, openness, care, or appropriate boundaries.

12
00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:05.390
Choose one word that feels relevant and believable.

13
00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:10.490
If no word arrives, use: present for the next step.

14
00:02:27.123 --> 00:02:29.583
Notice how the word lands in the body.

15
00:02:31.283 --> 00:02:34.793
It may feel meaningful, neutral, awkward, or distant.

16
00:02:36.493 --> 00:02:39.933
You do not need a strong feeling for the intention to be usable.

17
00:02:59.892 --> 00:03:02.802
Connect the intention to one concrete moment.

18
00:03:04.502 --> 00:03:09.112
If the quality is patience, perhaps feel both feet before answering a difficult message.

19
00:03:10.812 --> 00:03:14.452
If it is clarity, perhaps name the next single task.

20
00:03:37.737 --> 00:03:39.537
Picture only that small action.

21
00:03:41.237 --> 00:03:44.167
Keep the image ordinary and within your influence.

22
00:03:45.867 --> 00:03:47.637
Let the rest of the day remain unknown.

23
00:04:07.596 --> 00:04:08.706
Return to one breath.

24
00:04:10.406 --> 00:04:12.466
On the inhale, remember the chosen word.

25
00:04:14.166 --> 00:04:17.756
On the exhale, release any need to perform it perfectly.

26
00:04:41.041 --> 00:04:46.861
Consider what might make the intention difficult: fatigue, pressure, interruption, fear, or habit.

27
00:04:48.561 --> 00:04:52.621
Acknowledge one likely obstacle without treating it as failure in advance.

28
00:05:15.907 --> 00:05:17.717
Choose a cue that can help you remember.

29
00:05:19.417 --> 00:05:25.817
A doorway, unlocking the phone, sitting down, or taking a drink can become a brief invitation to return.

30
00:05:49.102 --> 00:05:50.762
Imagine encountering that cue.

31
00:05:52.462 --> 00:05:56.262
Feel one contact point, take one natural breath, and recall the word.

32
00:05:57.962 --> 00:06:00.532
The return can take only a few seconds.

33
00:06:27.144 --> 00:06:29.304
Notice whether the intention needs a boundary.

34
00:06:31.004 --> 00:06:32.534
Care may include saying no.

35
00:06:34.234 --> 00:06:36.114
Courage may include asking for help.

36
00:06:37.814 --> 00:06:41.144
Patience may include stopping a harmful delay.

37
00:07:04.429 --> 00:07:08.069
Refine the wording so it does not erase your needs or anyone else's reality.

38
00:07:09.769 --> 00:07:14.369
A useful intention guides behavior without demanding control over outcomes.

39
00:07:37.655 --> 00:07:43.535
Try a complete sentence: today, when I remember, I will meet the next workable moment with clarity.

40
00:07:45.235 --> 00:07:47.105
Replace clarity with your own word.

41
00:08:13.717 --> 00:08:14.767
Let the sentence go.

42
00:08:16.467 --> 00:08:18.727
Rest for several breaths without planning.

43
00:08:20.427 --> 00:08:22.887
Feel the body's weight and let sounds arrive.

44
00:08:49.499 --> 00:08:51.069
Bring the word back once more.

45
00:08:52.769 --> 00:08:56.049
Notice that forgetting later will not invalidate it.

46
00:08:57.749 --> 00:09:01.739
Each remembering is a fresh opportunity, not evidence about your character.

47
00:09:21.698 --> 00:09:22.938
Open awareness to the room.

48
00:09:24.638 --> 00:09:32.068
Identify the actual first step after this practice: stand, drink water, open a document, rest, or speak with someone.

49
00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.030
Begin moving when ready.

50
00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:54.940
Carry one modest direction rather than a demand for the whole day.

51
00:09:56.640 --> 00:10:00.000
Let reality keep informing how the intention is lived.
